One command whose function body holds a line directive naming a file of the target
too short to hold the positions it maps. The local the directive covers is no
declaration the inventory holds, and its position still does not render.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/unrendered

go 1.27.1
-- app.go --
package main

func main() { run() }

func run() {
//line short.txt:1
	x := 1
	_ = x
//line app.go:9
}
-- short.txt --
ab
